  id: SeaLighthouse
  displayName: Lighthouse
  description: 'A tall stone pharos with a keeper''s lodge and a great fire behind
    bronze mirrors. Beam: 18 tiles. Its beam guides your boats (they fish more and
    come home safely), speeds ships along, keeps pirates off your sea routes, and
    burns raiders'' and pirates'' hulls.'
